  "title": "Greek-Style Beef Stew (Stifado)",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s delicious Greek-style beef stifado stew pairs tender beef with sweet shallots in a tangy and aromatic slow-simmered sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-03-22T09:00:00-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2023-11-24T05:36:10-05:00",
